# Every change needs the owner's review once branch protection on `main` has
# "Require a pull request" and "Require review from Code Owners" turned on.
#
# Worth knowing: an AI tool connected to GitHub through your login acts AS
# you, so GitHub can't tell its changes from yours. Review rules stop
# collaborators and other accounts; they can't stop a tool holding your own
# login. The real limit on those is which repositories you grant them.
